REM 📍 Local Service Lead Grabber Macro
REM Title: 📍 Local Service Lead Grabber
REM Description: Queries Google Maps / Places for local service businesses (contractors, plumbers, roofers), scrolls through lead feed, and captures local business directory.
REM Tags: leads, b2b, sales, local-business, cold-outreach
REM Variables: NICHE, LOCATION, OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT

VAR NICHE=roofing contractors
VAR LOCATION=Virginia Beach VA
VAR OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT=local_leads_results.png

LOG Opening Google Maps for Local Lead Discovery
NAVIGATE https://www.google.com/maps
WAIT_FOR #searchboxinput, input#searchboxinput, input[name="q"] 10000
RANDOM_DELAY 1000 2000

LOG Searching for '$NICHE in $LOCATION'
STRING $NICHE in $LOCATION
RANDOM_DELAY 700 1300
ENTER

WAIT_FOR div[role="feed"], div[aria-label*="Results"], div[role="main"] 12000
RANDOM_DELAY 2500 4000

LOG Scrolling business lead feed
SCROLL 500
RANDOM_DELAY 1500 2500
SCROLL 500
RANDOM_DELAY 1500 2500

SCREENSHOT $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
LOG Local service leads captured to $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
